*> Entity models part 4 section 6 (Chicken): the meshes of chicken, cold_chicken and chicken_baby (6.3), the flap interpolation (6.1) and setupAnim (6.2).
*> Entry points for the integrator (inputs): EF4-CHICKEN-FLAP IN(partial, old value, new value) OUT(lerp) for flap and flapSpeed (6.1);
*>   EF4-CHICKEN-ANIM EMM-MODEL state(1 xRot, 2 yRot degrees, 3 walk position, 4 walk speed, 5 flap, 6 flapSpeed): leg swings, wing flap and (adult, cold) head turn, reset first. Model choice: EF4-VARIANT-MODEL.


 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. EF4-M-CHICKEN.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-ROWS.
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P head root 0 15 -4 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C head 0 0 -2 -6 -2 4 6 3 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P beak head 0 0 0 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C beak 14 0 -2 -4 -4 4 2 2 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P red_thing head 0 0 0 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C red_thing 14 4 -1 -2 -3 2 2 2 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P body root 0 16 0 1.5707964 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C body 0 9 -3 -4 -3 6 8 6 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P right_leg root -2 19 1 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C right_leg 26 0 -1 0 -3 3 5 3 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P left_leg root 1 19 1 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C left_leg 26 0 -1 0 -3 3 5 3 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P right_wing root -4 13 0 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C right_wing 24 13 0 0 -3 1 4 6 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P left_wing root 4 13 0 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C left_wing 24 13 -1 0 -3 1 4 6 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE SPACES OCCURS 64 TIMES.
 01 WS-ROWS-R REDEFINES WS-ROWS.
    05 WS-ROW              PIC X(100) OCCURS 80 TIMES.
 01 WS-N                   BINARY-LONG VALUE 16.
 01 WS-ZERO                FLOAT-LONG VALUE 0.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY CLEMM.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING EMM-MODEL.
     CALL "EMM-INIT" USING EMM-MODEL
     CALL "EM3-ROWS" USING EMM-MODEL WS-ROWS-R WS-N WS-ZERO
     MOVE 64 TO MM-TEXW
     MOVE 32 TO MM-TEXH
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM EF4-M-CHICKEN.

